Try eating fiery thing (red dragons, fire giants, etc.) for the intrinsic.
If all else fails, red dragon scale mail or the ring of fire res. will work,
but if a nymph should decide to borrow it while you're bashing through hell...

A cursed ring will still work, you just can't (directly) take it off.  Dipping
will remove a curse once in a while (the water glows), so will a scroll of
remove curse or praying to a happy god (occasionally).

But before you enter hell, search those four castle towers thoroughly!

